{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01957",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 5.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.88,
      "end_seconds": 10.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Of course, leave it it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.59,
      "end_seconds": 19.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "I've been dealing with stopping breathing at night. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.66,
      "end_seconds": 22.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.76,
      "end_seconds": 30.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I'm on valsartan, 80 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.62,
      "end_seconds": 35.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.85,
      "end_seconds": 39.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "for two days, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.05,
      "end_seconds": 44.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.66,
      "end_seconds": 50.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.01,
      "end_seconds": 54.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Have you had daytime sleepiness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.95,
      "end_seconds": 57.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.7,
      "end_seconds": 61.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "And what about choking or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.4,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "I haven't had choking or chest pain, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.29,
      "end_seconds": 75.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.21,
      "end_seconds": 77.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.94,
      "end_seconds": 94.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.45,
      "end_seconds": 99.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.95,
      "end_seconds": 120.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.2,
      "end_seconds": 126.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.88,
      "end_seconds": 139.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.73,
      "end_seconds": 144.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.75,
      "end_seconds": 146.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.95,
      "end_seconds": 153.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.58,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.78,
      "end_seconds": 162.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.92,
      "end_seconds": 165.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.37,
      "end_seconds": 170.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.05,
      "end_seconds": 173.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.31,
      "end_seconds": 177.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.33,
      "end_seconds": 182.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.17,
      "end_seconds": 191.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.65,
      "end_seconds": 220.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 167 over 98, saturation 97 percent. And respiratory rate 18, temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.25,
      "end_seconds": 225.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.25,
      "end_seconds": 230.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.45,
      "end_seconds": 234.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.25,
      "end_seconds": 245.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "You have a thick neck and a crowded throat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.83,
      "end_seconds": 250.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.14,
      "end_seconds": 274.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is probable obstructive sleep apnoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.34,
      "end_seconds": 279.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "ah, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.27,
      "end_seconds": 313.66,
      "duration_seconds": 32.39,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now probable obstructive sleep apnoea is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get a thyroid test, for tiredness. I want a home sleep study done, that's for snoring and apnoeas. Avoid alcohol in the evening, lose some weight if you can, and do not drive when drowsy. I think the sleep clinic should see you too. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.86,
      "end_seconds": 318.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the sleep study."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.75,
      "end_seconds": 321.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.03,
      "end_seconds": 329.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.39,
      "end_seconds": 336.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "so, I come back after the sleep study is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.89,
      "end_seconds": 342.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.32,
      "end_seconds": 351.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Ah, you know, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}